.TH LINUSTORVALDS 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.9" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
linustorvalds \- the kernel's blunt voice
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B linustorvalds
.RI [ \-\-once ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Watches the kernel journal (cursor-tracked) for err-and-worse
and translates dmesg into plain fault and blame: OOM, disk
errors, thermal, segfaults, USB dropouts, firmware, ACPI,
filesystem errors, full disks, hung tasks. No ceremony.
.SH FILES
.IR /run/ali-linus ,
.IR /var/log/linus.log
